 # Changelog
 
+## 1.5.0 (2026-11-15)
+
+- `POST /tickets/import` bulk-creates tickets (`{"tickets": [...]}`), all of a batch or none, at most 5000.
+
 ## 1.4.0 (2025-09-15)
 
 - The operator command line, `bin/tickets.js` (`list`, `show`), and the weekly report, `scripts/weekly-report.js`.
